  "source": "# The room of two doors\n\nKydux's own art, made for the game and under the GNU GPL, version 3 or\nlater, like the rest of it.\n\n- Painted by Gemini 3 Pro Image (`gemini-3-pro-image`) from\n  `tools/art/prompts/scene-two-doors.md`, then edited by it without its\n  grid (`game-two-doors-nogrid.md`).\n- What it left black at the corners painted by Gemini from\n  `game-two-doors-voids.md`, joined by `tools/art/repaint.py`, and what still\n  was black tiled from stones of the crossing's picture (`tiled`).\n- Each door opened by `tools/art/door.py` from the painting itself, no model asked.\n",
